{"id":"07a1592023f10b9f","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-ufam-per.md","title":"Eff 上的一致 PER 族","display":"df-uniform-families-of-pers — Eff 上的一致 PER 族","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-ufam-per","aliases":["16-df-ufam-per","Uniform families of PERs"],"display":"df-uniform-families-of-pers — Eff 上的一致 PER 族","depends_on":["[[16-df-per-category]]","[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]","[[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]","[[16-df-split-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition 6.3.1, p. 394 (PDF 414); Proposition 6.3.2, p. 395 (PDF 415)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-ufam-per"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-ufam-per</span><span>Uniform families of PERs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-uniform-families-of-pers — Eff 上的一致 PER 族"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bda3b5e2072d9169\" href=\"?note=bda3b5e2072d9169\" title=\"16-df-per-category\">16-df-per-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ffba7376827cc25\" href=\"?note=8ffba7376827cc25\" title=\"16-df-effective-global-sections\">16-df-effective-global-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"43c81e33a22655f0\" href=\"?note=43c81e33a22655f0\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-construction\">16-df-grothendieck-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 6.3.1, p. 394 (PDF 414); Proposition 6.3.2, p. 395 (PDF 415)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定足够大的宇宙使本页的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Eff}\">\\(\\mathbf{Eff}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PER}\">\\(\\mathbf{PER}\\)</span> 及族范畴可按小范畴编码；大小层次与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"43c81e33a22655f0\" href=\"?note=43c81e33a22655f0\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-construction\">16-df-grothendieck-construction</a> 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(I,\\rho)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}\">\\(A=(I,\\rho)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(i)=\\rho(i,i)\">\\(E(i)=\\rho(i,i)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0=\\{i\\in I\\mid E(i)\\ne\\varnothing\\}\">\\(I_0=\\{i\\in I\\mid E(i)\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma A\">\\(\\Gamma A\\)</span> 及只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0\">\\(I_0\\)</span> 上使用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[i]\">\\([i]\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ffba7376827cc25\" href=\"?note=8ffba7376827cc25\" title=\"16-df-effective-global-sections\">16-df-effective-global-sections</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tracks}(n,f;R,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tracks}(n,f;R,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_R\">\\(Q_R\\)</span> 及底层函数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H(R,S)\">\\(\\mathcal H(R,S)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bda3b5e2072d9169\" href=\"?note=bda3b5e2072d9169\" title=\"16-df-per-category\">16-df-per-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S,T\">\\(R,S,T\\)</span> 为下节的族对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_A(R,S)\">\\(\\mathcal F_A(R,S)\\)</span> 为未附源靶标签的共同跟踪函数族集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_A\">\\(U_A\\)</span> 为将它们附上源靶标签后的六元组范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:A\\to B\">\\(F:A\\to B\\)</span> 为Eff箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^*\">\\(F^*\\)</span> 的定义式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\\in O_B\">\\(R,S\\in O_B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F_B(R,S)\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F_B(R,S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^*\">\\(F^*\\)</span> 的对象与函数族作用、严格索引记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(U_0,U_1)\">\\(U=(U_0,U_1)\\)</span>、总投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 与规范分裂 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_q\">\\(\\kappa_q\\)</span> 在下节构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_1(F)\">\\(U_1(F)\\)</span> 的箭头为显式三元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int U\">\\(\\int U\\)</span> 的箭头为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"43c81e33a22655f0\" href=\"?note=43c81e33a22655f0\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-construction\">16-df-grothendieck-construction</a> 中的四标签记录。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}\\)</span> 采用本页依赖的完整签名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_A\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{PER})^{\\Gamma A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_A\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{PER})^{\\Gamma A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal F_A(R,S)\\coloneqq\\{(f_c)_{c\\in\\Gamma A}\\mid{}&amp;\n(\\forall c\\in\\Gamma A)\\ f_c\\in\\mathcal H(R_c,S_c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall i\\in I_0)(\\forall m\\in E(i))\ne\\cdot m\\downarrow\\land\\mathrm{Tracks}(e\\cdot m,f_{[i]};R_{[i]},S_{[i]})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal F_A(R,S)\\coloneqq\\{(f_c)_{c\\in\\Gamma A}\\mid{}&amp;\n(\\forall c\\in\\Gamma A)\\ f_c\\in\\mathcal H(R_c,S_c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall i\\in I_0)(\\forall m\\in E(i))\ne\\cdot m\\downarrow\\land\\mathrm{Tracks}(e\\cdot m,f_{[i]};R_{[i]},S_{[i]})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nM_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle R,S,f\\rangle\\mid R,S\\in O_A\\land f\\in\\mathcal F_A(R,S)\\},\\\\\ns_A\\langle R,S,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq R,&amp;t_A\\langle R,S,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq S,\\\\\ne_A(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R,R,(\\operatorname{id}_{Q_{R_c}})_{c\\in\\Gamma A}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_A(\\langle S,T,g\\rangle,\\langle R,S,f\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R,T,(g_cf_c)_{c\\in\\Gamma A}\\rangle,\\\\\nU_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_A,M_A,s_A,t_A,e_A,c_A\\rangle,\\\\\nF^*R&amp;\\coloneqq(R_{\\Gamma F(c)})_{c\\in\\Gamma A},&amp;F^*f&amp;\\coloneqq(f_{\\Gamma F(c)})_{c\\in\\Gamma A},\\\\\nU_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq U_A,\\\\\n(U_1(F))_0(R)&amp;\\coloneqq F^*R,&amp;(U_1(F))_1\\langle R,S,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F^*R,F^*S,F^*f\\rangle,\\\\\nU_1(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(U_1(F))_0,(U_1(F))_1\\rangle,\\\\\nU&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle U_0,U_1\\rangle,&amp;\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(U,\\mathbf{Eff})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nM_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle R,S,f\\rangle\\mid R,S\\in O_A\\land f\\in\\mathcal F_A(R,S)\\},\\\\\ns_A\\langle R,S,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq R,&amp;t_A\\langle R,S,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq S,\\\\\ne_A(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R,R,(\\operatorname{id}_{Q_{R_c}})_{c\\in\\Gamma A}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_A(\\langle S,T,g\\rangle,\\langle R,S,f\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R,T,(g_cf_c)_{c\\in\\Gamma A}\\rangle,\\\\\nU_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_A,M_A,s_A,t_A,e_A,c_A\\rangle,\\\\\nF^*R&amp;\\coloneqq(R_{\\Gamma F(c)})_{c\\in\\Gamma A},&amp;F^*f&amp;\\coloneqq(f_{\\Gamma F(c)})_{c\\in\\Gamma A},\\\\\nU_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq U_A,\\\\\n(U_1(F))_0(R)&amp;\\coloneqq F^*R,&amp;(U_1(F))_1\\langle R,S,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F^*R,F^*S,F^*f\\rangle,\\\\\nU_1(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(U_1(F))_0,(U_1(F))_1\\rangle,\\\\\nU&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle U_0,U_1\\rangle,&amp;\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(U,\\mathbf{Eff})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{UFam}(\\mathbf{PER})\\coloneqq\\textstyle\\int U,\\qquad q\\coloneqq p_U,\\qquad\\kappa_q\\coloneqq\\kappa_U,\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(q,\\kappa_q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{UFam}(\\mathbf{PER})\\coloneqq\\textstyle\\int U,\\qquad q\\coloneqq p_U,\\qquad\\kappa_q\\coloneqq\\kappa_U,\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(q,\\kappa_q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>恒等和复合在各 PER 中逐分量给出；共同 tracker 分别由常值恒等代码与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda m.\\lambda n.(d\\,m)((e\\,m)n)\">\\(\\lambda m.\\lambda n.(d\\,m)((e\\,m)n)\\)</span> 给出。</li>\n<li>对 Eff 箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>，其全定义与严格性实现代码把源存在证据一致地送到某个目标存在证据；再应用目标族的 tracker，即得重索引后的共同 tracker。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^*\">\\(F^*\\)</span> 是良定义函子。</li>\n<li>因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是实际函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}^*=\\operatorname{Id}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}^*=\\operatorname{Id}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(GF)^*=F^*G^*\">\\((GF)^*=F^*G^*\\)</span>，Grothendieck 构造得到所示分裂纤维化。</li>\n<li>原书对象族按全局元素的等价类索引，因而相等索引已经是同一个 PER；不需要原文件额外杜撰的“相等性代码生成 PER 同构”。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 6.3.1, p. 394 (PDF 414); Proposition 6.3.2, p. 395 (PDF 415)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-per-category","status":"resolved","id":"bda3b5e2072d9169","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-per-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-effective-global-sections","status":"resolved","id":"8ffba7376827cc25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-construction","status":"resolved","id":"43c81e33a22655f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-construction","status":"resolved","id":"43c81e33a22655f0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定足够大的宇宙使本页的 $\\mathbf{Eff}$、$\\mathbf{PER}$ 及族范畴可按小范畴编码；大小层次与 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]] 一致。$A=(I,\\rho)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}$，$E(i)=\\rho(i,i)$、$I_0=\\{i\\in I\\mid E(i)\\ne\\varnothing\\}$；$\\Gamma A$ 及只在 $I_0$ 上使用的 $[i]$ 采用 [[16-df-effective-global-sections]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-effective-global-sections","status":"resolved","id":"8ffba7376827cc25","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定足够大的宇宙使本页的 $\\mathbf{Eff}$、$\\mathbf{PER}$ 及族范畴可按小范畴编码；大小层次与 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]] 一致。$A=(I,\\rho)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}$，$E(i)=\\rho(i,i)$、$I_0=\\{i\\in I\\mid E(i)\\ne\\varnothing\\}$；$\\Gamma A$ 及只在 $I_0$ 上使用的 $[i]$ 采用 [[16-df-effective-global-sections]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-per-category","status":"resolved","id":"bda3b5e2072d9169","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tracks}(n,f;R,S)$、$Q_R$ 及底层函数集合 $\\mathcal H(R,S)$ 采用 [[16-df-per-category]]。$R,S,T$ 为下节的族对象；$\\mathcal F_A(R,S)$ 为未附源靶标签的共同跟踪函数族集合，$U_A$ 为将它们附上源靶标签后的六元组范畴。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-construction","status":"resolved","id":"43c81e33a22655f0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:A\\to B$ 为Eff箭头；$F^*$ 的定义式中 $R,S\\in O_B$、$f\\in\\mathcal F_B(R,S)$；$F^*$ 的对象与函数族作用、严格索引记录 $U=(U_0,U_1)$、总投影 $q$ 与规范分裂 $\\kappa_q$ 在下节构造。$U_1(F)$ 的箭头为显式三元组，$\\int U$ 的箭头为 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]] 中的四标签记录。$\\mathrm{SplitFib}$、$\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}$ 采用本页依赖的完整签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{Eff}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PER}","display":false},{"tex":"A=(I,\\rho)\\in\\mathbf{Eff}","display":false},{"tex":"E(i)=\\rho(i,i)","display":false},{"tex":"I_0=\\{i\\in I\\mid E(i)\\ne\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma A","display":false},{"tex":"I_0","display":false},{"tex":"[i]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tracks}(n,f;R,S)","display":false},{"tex":"Q_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H(R,S)","display":false},{"tex":"R,S,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_A(R,S)","display":false},{"tex":"U_A","display":false},{"tex":"F:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"F^*","display":false},{"tex":"R,S\\in O_B","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal F_B(R,S)","display":false},{"tex":"F^*","display":false},{"tex":"U=(U_0,U_1)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_q","display":false},{"tex":"U_1(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\int U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}","display":false},{"tex":"O_A\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{PER})^{\\Gamma A}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal F_A(R,S)\\coloneqq\\{(f_c)_{c\\in\\Gamma A}\\mid{}&\n(\\forall c\\in\\Gamma A)\\ f_c\\in\\mathcal H(R_c,S_c)\\\\\n&\\land(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall i\\in I_0)(\\forall m\\in E(i))\ne\\cdot m\\downarrow\\land\\mathrm{Tracks}(e\\cdot m,f_{[i]};R_{[i]},S_{[i]})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nM_A&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle R,S,f\\rangle\\mid R,S\\in O_A\\land f\\in\\mathcal F_A(R,S)\\},\\\\\ns_A\\langle R,S,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq R,&t_A\\langle R,S,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq S,\\\\\ne_A(R)&\\coloneqq\\langle R,R,(\\operatorname{id}_{Q_{R_c}})_{c\\in\\Gamma A}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_A(\\langle S,T,g\\rangle,\\langle R,S,f\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle R,T,(g_cf_c)_{c\\in\\Gamma A}\\rangle,\\\\\nU_A&\\coloneqq\\langle O_A,M_A,s_A,t_A,e_A,c_A\\rangle,\\\\\nF^*R&\\coloneqq(R_{\\Gamma F(c)})_{c\\in\\Gamma A},&F^*f&\\coloneqq(f_{\\Gamma F(c)})_{c\\in\\Gamma A},\\\\\nU_0(A)&\\coloneqq U_A,\\\\\n(U_1(F))_0(R)&\\coloneqq F^*R,&(U_1(F))_1\\langle R,S,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\langle F^*R,F^*S,F^*f\\rangle,\\\\\nU_1(F)&\\coloneqq\\langle(U_1(F))_0,(U_1(F))_1\\rangle,\\\\\nU&\\coloneqq\\langle U_0,U_1\\rangle,&\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(U,\\mathbf{Eff})&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{UFam}(\\mathbf{PER})\\coloneqq\\textstyle\\int U,\\qquad q\\coloneqq p_U,\\qquad\\kappa_q\\coloneqq\\kappa_U,\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(q,\\kappa_q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda m.\\lambda n.(d\\,m)((e\\,m)n)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}^*=\\operatorname{Id}","display":false},{"tex":"(GF)^*=F^*G^*","display":false}],"bytes":3758,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"}],"outgoing":["bda3b5e2072d9169","8ffba7376827cc25","43c81e33a22655f0","eb3d8d8bfc151af6"]}